So compute days offset d = number of days from 0001-01-01 to given date; weekday = d mod 7 where 0=Monday.

Days before year y (years 1..y-1): 365*(y-1) + number of leap years in [1, y-1]. Leap years: divisible by 4, not 100 unless 400. Count = floor((y-1)/4) - floor((y-1)/100) + floor((y-1)/400).

Days before month m in year y: cumulative with leap adjustment. Use table [0,31,59,90,120,151,181,212,243,273,304,334] for non-leap; add 1 if leap and m > 2.

Then d = 365*(y-1) + leaps + daysBeforeMonth + (day-1). weekday index = d % 7 (d ≥ 0). Map 0..6 to Monday..Sunday.

